# DAX Measures — Sales Retail Dashboard

All measures are stored in the `_Measures` table.  
Calculated columns are stored in their respective dimension tables (`Dim_Customer`, `Dim_Date`).

---

## 1. Core Financials

```dax
Total Revenue =
SUMX(Fact_Sales, Fact_Sales[Quantity] * Fact_Sales[UnitPrice] * (1 - Fact_Sales[DiscountPct]))
```

```dax
Total COGS =
SUMX(Fact_Sales, Fact_Sales[Quantity] * Fact_Sales[UnitCost])
```

```dax
Total Profit = [Total Revenue] - [Total COGS]
```

```dax
Gross Margin % = DIVIDE([Total Profit], [Total Revenue])
```

```dax
Total Quantity = SUM(Fact_Sales[Quantity])
```

```dax
Total Orders = DISTINCTCOUNT(Fact_Sales[OrderID])
```

```dax
Total Customers = DISTINCTCOUNT(Fact_Sales[CustomerID])
```

```dax
Average Order Value = DIVIDE([Total Revenue], [Total Orders])
```

```dax
Avg Discount % =
DIVIDE(
    SUMX(Fact_Sales, Fact_Sales[Quantity] * Fact_Sales[UnitPrice] * Fact_Sales[DiscountPct]),
    SUMX(Fact_Sales, Fact_Sales[Quantity] * Fact_Sales[UnitPrice])
)
```

