## 2. Time Intelligence

> Requires `Dim_Date` to be marked as a Date Table with `Dim_Date[Date]` as the date column.

```dax
Revenue PY =
CALCULATE([Total Revenue], SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR(Dim_Date[Date]))
```

```dax
Revenue YoY % = DIVIDE([Total Revenue] - [Revenue PY], [Revenue PY])
```

```dax
Revenue YTD = TOTALYTD([Total Revenue], Dim_Date[Date])
```

```dax
Revenue MTD = TOTALMTD([Total Revenue], Dim_Date[Date])
```

```dax
Revenue Prior Month =
CALCULATE([Total Revenue], DATEADD(Dim_Date[Date], -1, MONTH))
```

```dax
Revenue MoM % = DIVIDE([Total Revenue] - [Revenue Prior Month], [Revenue Prior Month])
```

```dax
Running Total Revenue =
CALCULATE(
    [Total Revenue],
    FILTER(ALLSELECTED(Dim_Date[Date]), Dim_Date[Date] <= MAX(Dim_Date[Date]))
)
```

