## 3. Target vs Actual

```dax
Total Target = SUM(Fact_Targets[TargetRevenue])
```

```dax
Target Achievement % = DIVIDE([Total Revenue], [Total Target])
```

```dax
Variance to Target = [Total Revenue] - [Total Target]
```

```dax
Target Status =
IF(
    [Target Achievement %] >= 1, "✅ Target Met",
    IF([Target Achievement %] >= 0.9, "⚠️ Near Target", "🔴 Below Target")
)
```

