## 4. Customer Analytics

```dax
New Customers =
CALCULATE(
    DISTINCTCOUNT(Fact_Sales[CustomerID]),
    FILTER(
        Dim_Customer,
        Dim_Customer[FirstPurchaseDate] >= MIN(Dim_Date[Date]) &&
        Dim_Customer[FirstPurchaseDate] <= MAX(Dim_Date[Date])
    )
)
```

```dax
Returning Customers = [Total Customers] - [New Customers]
```

```dax
Retention Rate % = DIVIDE([Returning Customers], [Total Customers])
```

