## 5. Advanced Analytics

### Store Ranking
```dax
Store Revenue Rank =
RANKX(ALL(Dim_Store[StoreName]), [Total Revenue], , DESC)
```

### Pareto / ABC Analysis
```dax
Product Cumulative Revenue % =
VAR AllProducts = ALL(Dim_Product[ProductName])
VAR CurrentRank = RANKX(AllProducts, CALCULATE([Total Revenue]), , DESC)
VAR CumulativeRevenue =
    SUMX(
        FILTER(AllProducts, RANKX(AllProducts, CALCULATE([Total Revenue]), , DESC) <= CurrentRank),
        CALCULATE([Total Revenue])
    )
VAR TotalAllProducts = CALCULATE([Total Revenue], ALL(Dim_Product[ProductName]))
RETURN DIVIDE(CumulativeRevenue, TotalAllProducts)
```

### Discount Simulation (What-if Parameter)
```dax
Simulated Revenue =
SUMX(
    Fact_Sales,
    Fact_Sales[Quantity] * Fact_Sales[UnitPrice] * (1 - 'Discount Simulator'[Discount Simulator Value])
)
```

```dax
Simulated Margin % = DIVIDE([Simulated Revenue] - [Total COGS], [Simulated Revenue])
```

### Dynamic Title
```dax
Dynamic Title =
"Sales Performance — " &
SELECTEDVALUE(Dim_Date[Year], "All Years") &
" | " &
SELECTEDVALUE(Dim_Store[Region], "All Regions")
```

