## 6. Calculated Columns

### Dim_Customer

```dax
FirstPurchaseDateKey = CALCULATE(MIN(Fact_Sales[DateKey]))
```

```dax
LastPurchaseDateKey = CALCULATE(MAX(Fact_Sales[DateKey]))
```

```dax
FirstPurchaseDate =
LOOKUPVALUE(Dim_Date[Date], Dim_Date[DateKey], Dim_Customer[FirstPurchaseDateKey])
```

```dax
LastPurchaseDate =
LOOKUPVALUE(Dim_Date[Date], Dim_Date[DateKey], Dim_Customer[LastPurchaseDateKey])
```

```dax
Recency (Days) = DATEDIFF(Dim_Customer[LastPurchaseDate], DATE(2025, 12, 31), DAY)
```

```dax
Frequency (Orders) = CALCULATE(DISTINCTCOUNT(Fact_Sales[OrderID]))
```

```dax
Monetary (Revenue) = CALCULATE([Total Revenue])
```

```dax
RFM Segment =
SWITCH(
    TRUE(),
    ISBLANK(Dim_Customer[Recency (Days)]), "➖ Never Purchased",
    Dim_Customer[Recency (Days)] <= 60 && Dim_Customer[Frequency (Orders)] >= 5, "🏆 Champion",
    Dim_Customer[Recency (Days)] <= 90 && Dim_Customer[Frequency (Orders)] >= 3, "💎 Loyal",
    Dim_Customer[Recency (Days)] <= 120, "🌱 Potential",
    Dim_Customer[Recency (Days)] > 180, "⚠️ At Risk",
    "➖ Regular"
)
```

### Dim_Date

```dax
MonthYearSort = Dim_Date[Year] * 100 + Dim_Date[Month]
```

> `MonthYearSort` is used as the **Sort by Column** value for `MonthYear` to ensure chronological ordering in visuals.

